    "Scanning took too long, so only the first %ld entries are shown. Some directories (usually ones synced by a cloud provider) answer very slowly. The time limit can be raised with the filePanel.general.flatViewMaxSeconds setting." : {
      "comment" : "Body of the alert shown when the flat scan hit its time budget; %ld is the number of entries that fit",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scanning took too long, so only the first %ld entries are shown. Some directories (usually ones synced by a cloud provider) answer very slowly. The time limit can be raised with the filePanel.general.flatViewMaxSeconds setting."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "扫描耗时过长，因此只显示了前 %ld 项。有些目录（通常是云服务同步的目录）响应非常慢。可以在设置项 filePanel.general.flatViewMaxSeconds 中提高时间上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cloud-synced directories (Library/CloudStorage and Library/Mobile Documents) are skipped in the flat view, so their contents are not listed. That can be changed with the filePanel.general.flatViewSkipCloudStorage setting." : {
